<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Synthetic C-CDA Results section. No patient data.

  Result Observations whose code names the test only by code, mixed in one
  section with a readable one:

    lab-readable        code with a displayName
    lab-code-text       code with only code/codeSystem; its <text> references
                        the narrative cell that names the test
    lab-code-bare       code with only code/codeSystem/codeSystemName and no
                        text anywhere: the code itself is the name
    lab-code-value      a coded (CD) result with only a code
    lab-unnamed         nothing names it: a null code, and a <text> whose
                        reference resolves to an empty cell of its own row

  Every observation has a narrative row, as the narrative-table reader would
  import them all; the structured reader must not import fewer.
-->
